The  driver  provides  support  for  Yamaha YMF711 (OPL3‐SA2) and
YMF715x (OPL3‐SA3) sound devices.  The OPL3‐SAx  device  has  WSS
compatible  full‐duplex  16bit  CODEC,  OPL3  FM synthesizer, and
MPU401  compatible  MIDI  I/O  port   interface.    Additionally,
OPL3‐SA3  has built‐in equalizer.  The joystick interface is han‐
dled by the driver.  The mixer device of driver can  be  accessed
by command.  The layout is shown below.
